    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extras/0e2170686e697453584956546304a0e5.avif?t=1741434901\" /></div><br><br>Six-ear Macaque is a challenging turn-based fighting game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3V3 turn-based combat.<br></li><li>All roles give orders at the same time.<br></li><li>Battle animations hand painted frame by frame.<br></li><li>The combat is fair and equal.<br></li><li>And the experience of each profession is unique.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extras/180549b694c248602955fce665e3c566.poster.avif?t=1741434901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extras/180549b694c248602955fce665e3c566.webm?t=1741434901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extras/a9b033ad941e6b72721174aedf15cead.poster.avif?t=1741434901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extras/a9b033ad941e6b72721174aedf15cead.webm?t=1741434901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extras/a9b033ad941e6b72721174aedf15cead.mp4?t=1741434901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extras/ad565a238f5b833cc566183a5781d989.poster.avif?t=1741434901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669000/extr